# Actions

- Class inherits its page: `public class Login : LoginPage`
- Ctor passes `(driver, TestContext)` to base
- Steps: touch elements via page properties; report with `ReportResult.ReportResultPass/Fail(Driver, context, nameof(Method), "msg")`
- Assertions on elements: `.ReportElementIsDisplayed(Driver, context, nameof(...), "msg", false)`
- Return `this` or `new NextScreen(driver, context)` for fluent chains
- **No** test assertions in actions except `Assert.Fail` after `ReportResultFail` on hard failures (match existing `Login.cs`)
- Golden: `STAFTests/Actions/Login.cs`, `AboutUs.cs`
